<!--
  Deliberately empty, and deliberately here.

  MSBuild walks up from a project directory and imports the *first* Directory.Build.props it
  finds. The repo root has one, and it exists to make the mod compile: it turns off implicit
  framework references and points FrameworkPathOverride at the game's Unity BCL, because
  Carto targets net48 against CS2's .NET Standard 2.1 assemblies.

  Every one of those settings is wrong for this tool, which is an ordinary net8.0 console app
  and wants the ordinary .NET 8 BCL. This file stops the upward search before the root one is
  reached. Removing it does not fail loudly — it fails as missing-type errors across the
  System namespace.
-->
<Project>
</Project>
